              highlighted: ["CM","CN"] },
            { text: "Therefore, parallelepipedal solids which are on the same base and of the same height,",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["CM","CN","AB"] },
            { text: "and in which the ends of their edges which stand up are on the same straight lines, equal one another.",
